--    * NO require(PlayerModule). Loading the game's control module from an executor is what
--      broke the mobile stick and the cursor. Phone input now comes from
--      humanoid.MoveDirection, which the game itself already feeds.
--    * Explicit mouse restore every time the fly starts or stops.
--  Extras: idle / move / boost animations, banking tilt, particle trail, glow.
